---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SearchOverlay from '../components/SearchOverlay.astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | SolversPro"
  description="Privacy Policy for SolversPro. Learn how we handle your data across our 78+ free online tools."
>
  <Header />
  <SearchOverlay />
  
  <main class="flex-1 py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-10">Effective Date: January 1, {year}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-zinc-400">
        <p>
          At SolversPro, we take your privacy very seriously. We built this platform to be fast, free, and secure, and part of that commitment means we do not unnecessarily collect, store, or sell your personal data.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We deliberately minimize the data we collect. The vast majority of our tools — including our PDF tools, developer utilities, text tools, math and finance calculators, health calculators, and trades calculators — run entirely in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. This means the data you input is processed locally on your device and is <strong>never sent to our servers</strong>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6 mb-3">1a. AI Solver & Third-Party AI APIs</h3>
        <p>
          For tools requiring artificial intelligence (such as the Universal AI Solver), your text prompts and uploaded images are securely transmitted to Google's Gemini API for processing. We do not store this data on our servers, and it is only used momentarily to generate your solution. Please refer to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for information on how they handle API data.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6 mb-3">1b. Network Tools & Third-Party Lookups</h3>
        <p>
          Certain network tools — including <strong>My IP Checker</strong>, <strong>IP Address Lookup</strong>, and <strong>IP Subnet Calculator</strong> — send requests to third-party geolocation APIs (such as ip-api.com and ipify.org) to retrieve IP address information, location data, and ISP details. When you use these tools, your IP address is transmitted to these external services. We do not store the results on our servers. Please refer to the respective third-party privacy policies for details on their data handling practices.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to collect basic, anonymous usage data (such as pages visited, time spent on the site, and general geographic region) to help us understand how our tools are being used and how we can improve them. Google Analytics may use cookies to collect this information. This data does not personally identify you. You can learn more about how Google uses data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Partner Sites page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display advertisements on certain pages. Google AdSense may use cookies and web beacons to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Use of Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We use local storage (a feature of your web browser) to save your preferences, such as selected settings in calculators and tool configurations. This data remains on your device and is not transmitted to us.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our site is a <strong>Progressive Web App (PWA)</strong>, which uses a service worker to cache static assets (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, images) for faster loading and offline access. This cached data is stored locally on your device and is not shared with us.
        </p>
        <p>
          Third-party services (Google Analytics, Google AdSense) may set their own cookies as described in sections 2 and 3 above.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. Beyond the third-party services explicitly described above (Google Gemini API, Google Analytics, Google AdSense, and geolocation APIs for network tools), no user data is shared with external parties. If you contact us via email or our contact form, we will use your provided email address solely to respond to your inquiry.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time as we add new tools and features to SolversPro. We encourage you to review this page periodically for any changes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
